{"id":"2a6ae68f45ba9960","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-three-valued-satisfaction.md","title":"一致正负外延的三值满足","display":"df-three-valued-satisfaction — 一致正负外延的三值满足","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-three-valued-satisfaction","aliases":["91-df-three-valued-satisfaction","91-df-3-valued-satisfaction","91-df-satisfaction-three-valued"],"display":"df-three-valued-satisfaction — 一致正负外延的三值满足","depends_on":["[[91-df-strong-kleene]]","[[91-df-ground-model]]","[[91-df-coded-syntax]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-three-valued-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-three-valued-satisfaction</span><span>91-df-3-valued-satisfaction</span><span>91-df-satisfaction-three-valued</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-three-valued-satisfaction — 一致正负外延的三值满足"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fcfe6f023ac58abf\" href=\"?note=fcfe6f023ac58abf\" title=\"91-df-strong-kleene\">91-df-strong-kleene</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"253f996295270684\" href=\"?note=253f996295270684\" title=\"91-df-ground-model\">91-df-ground-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N\">\\(\\mathcal N\\)</span> 是标准 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> 结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_T=\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\}\">\\(C_T=\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=(\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-)\">\\(\\Gamma=(\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-\\subseteq C_T\">\\(\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-\\subseteq C_T\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^+\\cap\\Gamma^-=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Gamma^+\\cap\\Gamma^-=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}(\\ulcorner t\\urcorner)=t^{\\mathcal N}\">\\(\\operatorname{val}(\\ulcorner t\\urcorner)=t^{\\mathcal N}\\)</span> 为闭项求值，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3\">\\(\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3\\)</span> 为满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fcfe6f023ac58abf\" href=\"?note=fcfe6f023ac58abf\" title=\"91-df-strong-kleene\">91-df-strong-kleene</a> 全部递归子句和以下原子条件的评估：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}three\\text{-}valued\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3(s=t)&amp;=\\begin{cases}\\mathbf t&amp;s^{\\mathcal N}=t^{\\mathcal N},\\\\\\mathbf f&amp;s^{\\mathcal N}\\ne t^{\\mathcal N};\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3(T(t))&amp;=\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf t&amp;t^{\\mathcal N}\\in\\Gamma^+,\\\\\n\\mathbf f&amp;t^{\\mathcal N}\\notin C_T\\text{ 或 }t^{\\mathcal N}\\in\\Gamma^-,\\\\\n\\mathbf u&amp;t^{\\mathcal N}\\in C_T\\setminus(\\Gamma^+\\cup\\Gamma^-).\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}three\\text{-}valued\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3(s=t)&amp;=\\begin{cases}\\mathbf t&amp;s^{\\mathcal N}=t^{\\mathcal N},\\\\\\mathbf f&amp;s^{\\mathcal N}\\ne t^{\\mathcal N};\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3(T(t))&amp;=\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf t&amp;t^{\\mathcal N}\\in\\Gamma^+,\\\\\n\\mathbf f&amp;t^{\\mathcal N}\\notin C_T\\text{ 或 }t^{\\mathcal N}\\in\\Gamma^-,\\\\\n\\mathbf u&amp;t^{\\mathcal N}\\in C_T\\setminus(\\Gamma^+\\cup\\Gamma^-).\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal N,\\Gamma)\\vDash_3\\varphi\\quad\\coloneqq\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\mathcal N,\\Gamma)\\vDash_3\\varphi\\quad\\coloneqq\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}^{\\mathcal N,\\Gamma}_3(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>递归在公式结构上良基且唯一。原子条件覆盖任意闭项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>，包括不表示句子的值；原书将这些 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(t)\">\\(T(t)\\)</span> 判假，旧版只给数码原子且把非句子误留为间隙。\n算术原子是二值的，结构归纳给出三值满足在基础语言上与经典满足相同。该满足关系不是可直接拿来做 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min\">\\(\\min\\)</span> 运算的真值对象。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 15.9–15.11、Lemma 15.12，印刷页 191–194，PDF 页 202–205。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-strong-kleene","status":"resolved","id":"fcfe6f023ac58abf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-strong-kleene]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ground-model","status":"resolved","id":"253f996295270684","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数